docs {
  # Hyper Reader API

  Requests for testing the backend locally.

  1. Start the backend from `backend/`: `uv run hyper-reader-api`
  2. Copy `bruno/.env.example` to `bruno/.env` and set `HYPER_READER_API_KEY`
     to the same value as in `backend/.env`.
  3. Select the **Local** environment in Bruno.

  Requests in `translate/` marked "real AI" call OpenAI and spend credits.
}
